From: iAmMichaelConnor <mike@aztec.foundation>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 17:02:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat!: uniquify every private note hash in the PXE's
 kernel-less simulation

A note hash emitted in private now uses its index in the private kernel's
output as its nonce index, revertible or not, in every tx. The PXE's
kernel-less simulation makes every private note hash unique once, before
splitting the note hashes by revertibility, matching the private kernel.

